@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About SoldierSave.com</PageTitle>

<h1>About SoldierSave.com</h1>

<p>
    SoldierSave is an open-source project that curates military benefits, discounts, and resources
    in a single, searchable place.
</p>

<p>
    The goal is simple: make it easier for Soldiers, veterans, and families to discover what they have
    earned, without hunting through dozens of sites, PDFs, or screenshots.
</p>

<p>
    This project is <strong>for warriors, by warriors</strong>; maintained in public, and designed
    to be easy to contribute to via GitHub issues and pull requests.
</p>

<p>
    Want to help? Add a new benefit, fix data, or improve the site:
    <a href="https://github.com/binbashburns/soldiersave.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Contribute on GitHub
    </a>.
</p>
